OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after death of
OL,4,Ae-biker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorist has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a man on an e-bike.
OL,10,FBedfordshire Police was called to
OL,11,FDallow Road in Luton at about 22:50 BST
OL,12,Fon Friday, where they found a seriously
OL,13,Finjured man who was believed to have
OL,14,Fbeen struck by a vehicle. He died
OL,15,Fshortly afterwards.
OL,17,FThe arrested man, who is in his 20s,
OL,18,Fremains in police custody.
OL,20,FWitnesses and anyone with dashcam
OL,21,Ffootage have been asked to contact
OL,22,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
